dding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.35pt;\"\u003e9.\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:232.35pt;\"\u003eAAT Properties Private Limited\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:179.55pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eDirector\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#60CAF3;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.35pt;\"\u003e10.\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:232.35pt;\"\u003ePurva Blue Dwelling Private Limited\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:179.55pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eDirector\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#60CAF3;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.35pt;\"\u003e11.\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:232.35pt;\"\u003ePurva Blue Home Ventures Private Limited\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:26.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:179.55pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eDirector\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e","Image":{"data":{"id":2840,"attributes":{"name":"Ashish-R.-Puravankara,-Managing-Director,-Puravankara-Limited.jpg","alternativeText":"Ashish Puravankara","caption":null,"width":1034,"height":974,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/large_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e.jpg","hash":"large_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"large_Ashish-R.-Puravankara,-Managing-Director,-Puravankara-Limited.jpg","path":null,"size":111.48,"width":1000,"height":942,"sizeInBytes":111484},"small":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/small_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e.jpg","hash":"small_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"small_Ashish-R.-Puravankara,-Managing-Director,-Puravankara-Limited.jpg","path":null,"size":41.86,"width":500,"height":471,"sizeInBytes":41856},"medium":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/medium_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e.jpg","hash":"medium_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"medium_Ashish-R.-Puravankara,-Managing-Director,-Puravankara-Limited.jpg","path":null,"size":74.46,"width":750,"height":706,"sizeInBytes":74460},"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_Ashish-R.-Puravankara,-Managing-Director,-Puravankara-Limited.jpg","path":null,"size":7.54,"width":166,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":7541}},"hash":"Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":118.12,"url":"/uploads/Ashish_R_Puravankara_Managing_Director_Puravankara_Limited_5707207b4e.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-07-04T11:51:36.379Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-25T09:39:05.326Z"}}}}},{"id":10,"attributes":{"Name":"Ms. Amanda Joy Puravankara","Description":"\u003cp\u003eHaving been involved in the business from an early age, Amanda Joy Puravankara carved a niche for herself in the organisation. She understands the needs of aspiring homebuyers and is aligned with Puravankara Limited's vision of \"Always About You\".\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt Puravankara Limited, she oversees technology, customer initiatives, new business development, organisational behaviour and culture. She is deeply involved in the product development lifecycle - right from land acquisition, concept \u0026amp; design to market strategies. She is abreast of the current industry trends in the realty sector, especially technology. Her knowledge and insights help the brand offer products and solutions to stay ahead of the curve.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmanda holds a Bachelor's degree in Psychology with Honours from the University of Southampton, England and has completed the Executive General Management program at the Indian Institute of Management-Bangalore. In 2021, she was recognised as one of the top '40 under 40' entrepreneurs for her exemplary contribution to the realty sector. She has been honoured with several awards, including 'Woman Achiever of the Year' at the Economic Times Business Excellence Awards 2022-2023, Women Entrepreneur of the Year 2018-19 by Quikr Homes, Women Entrepreneur by Business Connect and Women in Corporate Award 2019 for Innovation by Women's Web.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmanda is a strong advocate for women's empowerment, diversity and inclusion. She is also passionate about travelling and fitness and runs the Davedaan Trust, which works for women's rights.\u003c/p\u003e","createdAt":"2025-08-11T10:32:22.580Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T06:28:03.691Z","publishedAt":"2025-08-11T10:33:59.478Z","position":"Whole-Time Director","subpos":"Board Member, Member of Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) Committee, Stakeholder Relationship Committee, Risk Management Committee and Management Sub-Committee.","slug":"amanda-joy-puravankara","leadership_description":"\u003cp\u003eAmanda Joy Puravankara has been exposed to the business from a very early age and has created her own niche in the organisation. She has an in-depth understanding of the aspirations of contemporary homebuyers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs the Director of Puravankara Limited, she oversees critical functions such as technology, customer-centric initiatives, new business development, and organizational culture. She has been an integral part of the product development process right from land acquisition, concept \u0026amp; design to market strategies. With an in-depth understanding of the changing dynamics of the industry, especially in the real estate technology sector, her inputs have helped the organization to be at the forefront in the industry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmanda was conferred the title of being one of the top ‘40 Under 40’ entrepreneurs in 2021 for her outstanding contributions to the real estate sector.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eApart from her professional life, she has been an ardent advocate for the empowerment of women. Extremely passionate about travel and fitness, Amanda has been the guiding light behind the Davedaan Trust, which works for the empowerment of women.\u003c/p\u003e","full_time_positions":"\u003ch3 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#215E99;\"\u003eDirectorships and full-time positions in Body Corporates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"table\"\u003e\u003ctable s